Package: rwbiomarker
Title: Biomarker-Stratified Real-World Survival Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "RWE",
           family = "Demo",
           email = "rwe-demo@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Educational R package illustrating a biomarker-stratified
    real-world survival analysis. Uses the publicly available
    'survival::colon' adjuvant chemotherapy dataset as a stand-in for an
    EHR-derived oncology cohort and augments it with a simulated tumor
    biomarker (e.g., MSI status). Provides utilities to derive overall
    survival, attach the biomarker, and estimate biomarker-specific
    treatment effects via Cox proportional hazards, including
    treatment-by-biomarker interaction tests and a subgroup forest plot.
